{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 7, :comments ["<b>And ram skins.</b> Masculine, like לוחות and בכורות בקרך (Deuteronomy 14:23)." "<b>Shittim.</b> With a mem, like נשים."], :book :exodus, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 35, :notes {0 "The lemma וערת (ram skins) is morphologically feminine in form; Ibn Ezra notes instances where feminine-form nouns take masculine agreement or are treated as masculine."}, :source-witnesses [["Piotrkow, 1907-1911" "https://www.nli.org.il/he/books/NNL_ALEPH990020973480205171/NLI"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T18:40:32.881161190Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}